source: crates/jailint/tests/rules.rs
---
warning[lossy_xx]: `xx` converts `s64` to `u16`, which can lose the high bits
  --> tests/lint/lossy_xx/example.jai:5:18
   |
 5 |     small: u16 = xx big;
   |                  ^^^^^^
   |
help: write `cast(u16)` to make the conversion visible
   |
 4       big := 70000;
 5 ~     small: u16 = cast(u16) big;
 6       print("%\n", small);
   |
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/lossy_xx
